- The problems are made by code in this repository (src/tasks.mjs). No dataset is used, and nothing in a problem
  describes a real person or company.
- vendor/memory.mjs is the estate's twelve-chamber memory kernel, from the estate-nest repository
  (kernel/fall-remember.mjs), with comments removed and no code changed. vendor/stats.mjs is the exact McNemar test
  from the docdecdemo repository. Both are recorded with their hashes in vendor/PROVENANCE.json.
- The model is not part of this repository. The page fetches Llama 3.2 1B Instruct (Meta, Llama 3.2 Community Licence)
  from the MLC project's published build when the viewer presses Load, and runs it with WebLLM 0.2.79 (Apache 2.0).
- Cloud prices in data/prices.json are read from the publisher's own price page on the date recorded there. They are
  used only to show what the same tokens would cost if bought by the token.
